    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>01. Social Activities</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/db90ceae83ffe5667c99ab8365b87da9.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/db90ceae83ffe5667c99ab8365b87da9.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/db90ceae83ffe5667c99ab8365b87da9.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with friends to complete missions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your room with furniture and wallpapers, visit your friends' rooms, and use the messaging feature to send notes and stay connected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>02.\u00a0Match-Based Mini-Games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d13230b13979265dc73e29161a46caa0.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d13230b13979265dc73e29161a46caa0.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d13230b13979265dc73e29161a46caa0.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/2852ecaa7b92237444b1744b85a2311c.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/2852ecaa7b92237444b1744b85a2311c.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/2852ecaa7b92237444b1744b85a2311c.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/130e19ac89aaf6c9dccb509e592ab769.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/130e19ac89aaf6c9dccb509e592ab769.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/130e19ac89aaf6c9dccb509e592ab769.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in real-time across a variety of match-based game modes, including Team Deathmatch, Battle Royale, Capture the Flag, Hide &amp; Seek, Soccer, and Obstacle Races. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 12 game modes currently available, more are being added regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >03.\u00a0<strong>Character Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/c3af076748af1d4e603176a06a5ed898.avif?t=1749712881\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f57d68e5769263a7afc9c7860158ecc8.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f57d68e5769263a7afc9c7860158ecc8.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f57d68e5769263a7afc9c7860158ecc8.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your unique character with over 1,000 parts, emotes, and actions\u2014including tops, bottoms, hairstyles, hats, shoes, weapon skins, pets, and expressive emotes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your personal style and make your character truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>01. Social Activities</strong><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/db90ceae83ffe5667c99ab8365b87da9.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/db90ceae83ffe5667c99ab8365b87da9.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/db90ceae83ffe5667c99ab8365b87da9.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d4815acd4b57a2e4c69429056fdc4dda.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collaborate with friends to complete missions! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your room with furniture and wallpapers, visit your friends' rooms, and use the messaging feature to send notes and stay connected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>02.\u00a0Match-Based Mini-Games</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d13230b13979265dc73e29161a46caa0.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d13230b13979265dc73e29161a46caa0.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/d13230b13979265dc73e29161a46caa0.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/2852ecaa7b92237444b1744b85a2311c.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/2852ecaa7b92237444b1744b85a2311c.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/2852ecaa7b92237444b1744b85a2311c.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/130e19ac89aaf6c9dccb509e592ab769.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/130e19ac89aaf6c9dccb509e592ab769.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/130e19ac89aaf6c9dccb509e592ab769.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in real-time across a variety of match-based game modes, including Team Deathmatch, Battle Royale, Capture the Flag, Hide &amp; Seek, Soccer, and Obstacle Races. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 12 game modes currently available, more are being added regularly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >03.\u00a0<strong>Character Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/c3af076748af1d4e603176a06a5ed898.avif?t=1749712881\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f57d68e5769263a7afc9c7860158ecc8.poster.avif?t=1749712881\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f57d68e5769263a7afc9c7860158ecc8.webm?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728650/extras/f57d68e5769263a7afc9c7860158ecc8.mp4?t=1749712881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your unique character with over 1,000 parts, emotes, and actions\u2014including tops, bottoms, hairstyles, hats, shoes, weapon skins, pets, and expressive emotes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your personal style and make your character truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
